<section class="relative z-10 bg-paper px-5 sec text-ink lg:px-[33px]" id="faq"><div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1920px] gap-8 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-5"><div class="flex h-fit flex-col gap-6 lg:sticky lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+32px)]"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 h-fit"><span class="t-mono text-brand">(10)</span><span class="t-mono text-ink">Answers</span></div><h2 aria-label="FAQ." class="block t-display text-[clamp(45px,6vw,80px)] leading-[0.9]"><span aria-hidden="true"><span><span class="split-word" style="overflow:hidden;padding-top:0.26em;padding-bottom:0.26em;margin-top:-0.26em;margin-bottom:-0.26em"><span class="split-char" data-split-piece="char" style="transform:translateY(140%)">F</span><span class="split-char" data-split-piece="char" style="transform:translateY(140%)">A</span><span class="split-char" data-split-piece="char" style="transform:translateY(140%)">Q</span><span class="split-char" data-split-piece="char" style="transform:translateY(140%)">.</span></span></span></span></h2><p class="t-cond-soft max-w-[28ch] text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-ash">Six things every founder asks before the first call.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:col-span-3 lg:gap-14"><ul class="flex flex-col" data-faq-list="true"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-px w-full origin-left bg-current opacity-15" data-faq-rule="true"></span><h3><button aria-controls="home-faq-panel-0" aria-expanded="true" class="group/faq grid w-full grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left transition-[padding-left] duration-[700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] lg:gap-8 lg:py-7 lg:group-hover/faq:pl-2" data-cursor="link" data-faq-head="true" id="home-faq-trigger-0" type="button"><span class="t-mono nums mt-[0.45em] transition-colors duration-500 text-brand">01</span><span class="t-display text-[clamp(19px,2.2vw,30px)] leading-[1.1] transition-colors duration-500 text-brand">What's the difference between monthly and per project?</span><span aria-hidd