auto_1fr] gap-4 pb-7 lg:gap-8"><span aria-hidden="true" class="t-mono invisible">00</span><p class="t-cond-soft max-w-[68ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.6] opacity-70">It's a real starting number, not a teaser. Scope is the only thing that moves it: an extra page, a second brand direction, a deadline that needs two of us. We lock the figure on the first call and it holds from there.</p></div></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-px w-full origin-left bg-current opacity-15" data-faq-rule="true"></span><h3><button aria-controls="home-faq-panel-2" aria-expanded="false" class="group/faq grid w-full grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left transition-[padding-left] duration-[700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] lg:gap-8 lg:py-7 lg:group-hover/faq:pl-2" data-cursor="link" data-faq-head="true" id="home-faq-trigger-2" type="button"><span class="t-mono nums mt-[0.45em] transition-colors duration-500 opacity-55">03</span><span class="t-display text-[clamp(19px,2.2vw,30px)] leading-[1.1] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover/faq:text-brand">How long will it take?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative mt-[0.35em] flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute h-4 w-px bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="home-faq-trigger-2" class="h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0" id="home-faq-panel-2" role="region"><div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 pb-7 lg:gap-8"><span aria-hidden="true" class="t-mono invisible">00</span><p class="t-cond-soft max-w-[68ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.6] opacity-70">Two to four weeks for a single piece of work, four to six for a full brand and site. We only take two clients a month, so your start date is real rather than a spot in a queue.</p></div></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-px w-full origin-left bg-current opacity-15" data-faq-rule="true"></span><h3><button aria-controls="home-faq-panel-3" aria-expanded="false" class="group/faq grid w-full grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left transition-[padding-left] duration-[700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] lg:gap-8 lg:py-7 lg:group-hover/faq:pl-2" data-cursor="link" data-faq-head="true" id="home-faq-trigger-3" type="button"><span class="t-mono nums mt-[0.45em] transition-colors duration-500 opacity-55">04</span><span class="t-display text-[clamp(19px,2.2vw,30px)] leading-[1.1] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover/faq:text-brand">Who actually does the work?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative mt-[0.35em] flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute h-4 w-px bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="home-faq-trigger-3" class="h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0" id="home-faq-panel-3" role="region"><div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 pb-7 lg:gap-8"><span aria-hidden="true" class="t-mono invisible">00</span><p class="t-cond-soft max-w-[68ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.6] opacity-70">The founder. You hire Noma, you get Noma. No juniors, no handoffs, no account manager relaying your feedback.</p></div></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-px w-full origin-left bg-current opacity-15" data-faq-rule="true"></span><h3><button aria-controls="home-faq-panel-4" aria-expanded="false" class="group/faq grid w-full grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left transition-[padding-left] duration-[700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] lg:gap-8 lg:py-7 lg:group-hover/faq:pl-2" data-cursor="link" data-faq-head="true" id="home-faq-trigger-4" type="button"><span class="t-mono nums mt-[0.45em] transition-colors duration-500 opacity-55">05</span><span class="t-display text-[clamp(19px,2.2vw,30px)] leading-[1.1] transition-colors 